1
00:00:00,977 --> 00:00:02,737
(Sheldon:)That never gets old.

2
00:00:02,913 --> 00:00:04,503
(Sheldon:)Release the Kraken!

3
00:00:04,681 --> 00:00:06,201
(Sheldon:)Oh, chills.

4
00:00:06,383 --> 00:00:09,043
(Sheldon:)Besides, I'm having dinner with Amy.

5
00:00:09,453 --> 00:00:11,983
(Raj:)Oh, okay. I'll just go home and be alone.

6
00:00:12,189 --> 00:00:16,559
(Raj:)Which is cool.
I eat alone, I sleep alone, I cry alone, so...

7
00:00:17,394 --> 00:00:18,414
(Raj:)...cool.

8
00:00:20,797 --> 00:00:21,887
(Sheldon:)Darn.

9
00:00:22,065 --> 00:00:24,895
(Sheldon:)If you weren't busy I'd ask you to join us.

10
00:00:25,569 --> 00:00:28,299
(Raj:)Really? I can come? Thanks.

11
00:00:28,505 --> 00:00:31,565
Sheldon, are you sure you wanna bring Raj
on your date night?

12
00:00:31,742 --> 00:00:33,442
(Sheldon:)Oh, absolutely.

13
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:36,080
(Sheldon:)I have a contractual obligation...

14
00:00:36,246 --> 00:00:39,846
(Sheldon:)...to provide Amy with conversation
and casual physical contact.

15
00:00:40,016 --> 00:00:44,456
(Sheldon:)But nowhere is it specified
that I can't outsource that to an Indian.

16
00:00:49,793 --> 00:00:51,313
(Bernadette(on webcam):)Howie?

17
00:00:51,862 --> 00:00:55,662
(Bernadette(on webcam):)- Howie?
- Hey, there's my beautiful bride.

18
00:00:55,832 --> 00:00:58,032
(Howard:)- Can you see me?
- I can.

